ferrosintesis-samples-musescore-grand
=====================================

The embedded WAV samples in this crate are extracted from the "Grand Piano"
preset of the MuseScore_General soundfont (MuseScore_General.sf3), the MF
velocity tier.

MuseScore_General is shared under the MIT license (as described in its COPYING),
"as was FluidR3Mono and FluidR3 before it".

